    "body": "This quiz uses everyday lifestyle clues—including routine, food, movement, sleep, stress, social energy, curiosity and small brain teasers—to create a playful personality-style result. The questions touch on familiar health and wellbeing themes such as nutrition, physical activity, recovery, healthy habits, mental wellbeing, social connection and attitudes towards healthy ageing.\n\nYour choices are combined with a short memory and reasoning check to produce an entertainment estimate and a lifestyle profile, with deliberately restrained scoring so one answer cannot dominate the outcome. It can be a light-hearted prompt for self-reflection about daily routines and wellness priorities.\n\nThe quiz does not use medical records, clinical research, family history, current age, healthcare data or an individual risk assessment. The displayed estimate is a quiz mechanic based only on the answers selected during this session.",
