    "disclaimer": "This quiz is for entertainment and self-reflection only. It does not predict your lifespan, health, future, mortality risk, or medical outcomes. Results are playful lifestyle-style profiles based only on your quiz choices. If you have health concerns, speak to a qualified healthcare professional."
